                        "entry_id": "370007f8-0726-3cf7-9000-2a5899d87a90",
                        "glosses": [
                            "female equivalent of трус (trus): a cowardly woman or girl"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial",
                            "feminine",
                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9f71330e-dfd6-42e9-877a-0c42b7acb6db",
                                "sense_id": "d7706598-27b6-31aa-b5fd-9f8f6289ae85",
                                "text": "— Смела ли Маша? — отвечала её мать. — Нет, Маша трусиха. До сих пор не может слышать выстрела из ружья: так и затрепещется.",
                                "translation": "\"Masha brave?\" answered her mother. \"No, Masha is a coward. She cannot even hear a gun fired without trembling all over.",
                                "english": "\"Masha brave?\" answered her mother. \"No, Masha is a coward. She cannot even hear a gun fired without trembling all over."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
